clozapine

25
00:00:24,622 --> 00:00:26,262
Ubat ni untuk skizofrenia

26
00:00:26,262 --> 00:00:27,123
yang tak respon

27
00:00:27,123 --> 00:00:28,223
dengan ubat lain.

28
00:00:28,223 --> 00:00:29,243
Ia sangat berkesan,

29
00:00:29,243 --> 00:00:30,683
tapi antara yang paling tinggi

30
00:00:30,683 --> 00:00:32,223
risiko naik berat badan.

31
00:00:32,223 --> 00:00:33,603
Selera makan bertambah,

32
00:00:33,603 --> 00:00:35,343
