36
00:00:38,204 --> 00:00:39,524
Kedua, olanzapine

37
00:00:39,524 --> 00:00:40,964
Digunakan untuk skizofrenia

38
00:00:40,964 --> 00:00:41,824
dan bipolar.

39
00:00:41,824 --> 00:00:42,684
Ia kuat menyekat

40
00:00:42,684 --> 00:00:44,164
histamin dan serotonin,

41
